															<p align="center"><strong><font size="4">New Member Policies</font></strong></p> <p align="left"> <hr align="center" width="100%" size="2" /> <p></p> <ul> <li> <div class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">New members and probationary members should read the guild charter and <a href="/custom.aspx?pid=1035">guild rules </a>and make sure you understand them fully.</div> <li> <div class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">Applicants gain&nbsp;DKP just like established members. However, they cannot vote on raid or guild bank items against a full member, until their app status is ended.</div> <li> <div class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">&nbsp;Apps cannot become officers or raid looters during their app period. </div> <li> <div class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">Tell us a little about yourself such as your character name, class and level, as well as why you would like to join MR, etc.&nbsp;</div> <li> <div class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">We take characters of all races and classes. We are looking for characters in their 55th season or higher.&nbsp;&nbsp; Alts are always welcome</div> <li> <div class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">Reports of misconduct may result in immediate removal. All probationary members are subject to removal with or without previous notification or reason. </div> <li> <div class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">Our current "official" raid times are Monday, Wednesday,&nbsp;Thursday, Saturday and Sunday nights at 8pm central standard time (6 pm pdt, or 9pm est)&nbsp; Raids are not limited soley to these days however.</div></li></ul> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt">&nbsp;</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><font size="4"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 20pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt"><font size="4">Membership</font> <font size="4">Requirements Detailed</font>:</span></b><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 20pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt">&nbsp;<?xml:namespace prefix = o /><o:p></o:p></span></b></font></p> <div class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"> <hr align="center" width="100%" size="2" /> </div> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">Probationary period exists for all new members. There are essentially&nbsp;4 requirements to be met before you become a "Full Member". </p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">A.&nbsp; You must be level&nbsp;55 or higher.</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">B.&nbsp;&nbsp;You must post an application.</p> <p class="MsoBodyTextIndent" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">C.&nbsp; You must be a member for 4 weeks, and attend 5 or more raids&nbsp;depending on your level of dedication to the guild and its members at the time.</p> <p class="MsoNormal" style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.25in">D.&nbsp; You must not violate any guild rules during this period, if you do so in bad standing, you jeopardize your membership.</p>
